 " (1 forward, \[Minus]1 backward, 0 none)."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"fbae27af-1d06-4612-b76c-f561dab6373b"],

Cell["\<\
The returned function accepts a list of points or a curve primitive and \
produces graphics primitives.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"93c4eb0c-e1e0-42c0-8201-862639fb014e"],

